entries[456595] = { ["name"] = "Whispers of the Deep", ["text"] = "Instant\nNotably forming packed swarms, this fish gets its namesake from the friction of its inky black scales oscillating against each other. These vibrations act as a deterrent for predators and create an audible sound that can be heard above the water.\n\nSpecial:\n\nWhispers of the Deep\n\nUse the Whispering Stargazer to draw out Slumbering Coelacanths from the depths of Azj-Kahet.\n\nAreas you can find this fish:\n\n- Isle of Dorn\n- The Ringing Deeps\n- Hallowfall\n- Siren Isle\n- K'aresh Oasis\n\nFishing Pools:\n\n- Stargazer Swarm" }
